    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_e036be9d_label",
      "label": "Accordion3.Header — Label",
      "default": "What is Ventral?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_80fc352e_value",
      "label": "Heading2 — Value",
      "default": "Ventral is a powered inflatable fishing kayak built around a mid-mount drive, an open fishing deck, and seated or standing fishing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_87041b39_label",
      "label": "Accordion3.Header — Label",
      "default": "Do I need a trailer?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_bc3864f6_value",
      "label": "Heading2 — Value",
      "default": "Ventral is designed to pack down for car-friendly transport without requiring a dedicated trailer. Vehicle fit depends on available cargo space."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_9fc8c024_label",
      "label": "Accordion3.Header — Label",
      "default": "Is the battery integrated into the motor, or is it a separate module?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_9abb21ac_value",
      "label": "Heading2 — Value",
      "default": "The Smart Mid-Mount Drive consists of four key components:Removable Propulsion Module; Removable LiFePO₄ Battery Module; Integrated 3-Button Foot-Control Base; Tool-Free Quick-Release PropellerThe battery is not built into the motor. It is a separate removable LiFePO₄ battery module that connects to the propulsion system. This modular design allows for easy installation, charging, replacement, and transportation."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_3db854a5_label",
      "label": "Accordion3.Header — Label",
      "default": "How long can it run?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_ce60c220_value",
      "label": "Heading2 — Value",
      "default": "Runtime varies with speed, load, water conditions, wind, and control use. Verified runtime results and test conditions will be published before launch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_92008e0c_label",
      "label": "Accordion3.Header — Label",
      "default": "Can I use it in saltwater?&nbsp; &nbsp;"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_b3b087be_value",
      "label": "Heading2 — Value",
      "default": "Final saltwater-use and maintenance guidance is still being confirmed. Verified care instructions will be shared before launch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_0b5912a5_label",
      "label": "Accordion3.Header — Label",
      "default": "Can I stand and cast?"
    },
